---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  lang="en"
  altPath=""
  i18n={true}
  title="Relationship Psychology for Women — Valentina Ageeva | For family, without «just leave»"
  description="I help women stay in their relationships and be happy in them. A free attachment-style test and the course «Relationships for a Lifetime»."
  keywords="relationship psychology, how to save a relationship, attachment style test, relationship coach for women, Gottman, Sue Johnson, Valentina Ageeva"
  canonical="https://ageeva.win/en.html"
  ogTitle="Relationship Psychology for Women — Valentina Ageeva. For family, without «just leave»"
  ogDescription="I help women stay in their relationships and be happy in them. Free attachment-style test and the course «Relationships for a Lifetime»."
  twTitle="Relationship Psychology for Women — Valentina Ageeva"
  twDescription="Stay in your relationship and be happy. Free attachment-style test + the course «Relationships for a Lifetime»."
>

<!-- 1. HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Relationship psychology</span>
      <h1>Everyone teaches you to leave.<br>I teach you to stay —<br>and not regret it.</h1>
      <p class="lead">You don't have to rescue the relationship, you don't have to grovel — you already know how to love and be loved. No one just explained the mechanics of what to actually do. I'll help you out of the loop of the same old mistakes.</p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a href="/en/free.html" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Take the free test →</a>
        <a href="/en/course.html" class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg">About the course «Relationships for a Lifetime»</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="photo photo--portrait">
      <img src="/assets/photo-hero.webp" alt="Valentina Ageeva" width="853" height="1280" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 2. SOUND FAMILIAR -->
<section class="section bg-cream2">
  <div class="container center">
    <span class="eyebrow">Sound familiar?</span>
    <h2>If you're in a relationship where…</h2>
    <hr class="rule center">
    <ul class="pain">
      <li>you love each other, but the same fight keeps repeating on a loop;</li>
      <li>you speak — and he shuts down, goes silent, or disappears into his phone;</li>
      <li>you're always the first to make up, and something inside keeps piling up because of it;</li>
      <li>there's less and less tenderness and sex, and «let's talk» turns into accusations every time;</li>
      <li>you sometimes catch yourself thinking «maybe it's easier on my own» — but you don't actually want to leave;</li>
      <li>you do everything yourself — because «it's faster» or «he won't do it right»;</li>
      <li>you carry the home, the relationship, sometimes him too — and he never quite asked, but never stopped you either;</li>
      <li>relationships end in roughly the same place — and you'd finally like to understand the pattern;</li>
      <li>you can't hold a relationship longer than a few months — and you don't understand why.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="lead narrow" style="margin-top:28px">It doesn't mean everything is broken. It means you're stuck in a loop no one has shown you the way out of. I show you.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- MY APPROACH -->
<section class="section bg-blush">
  <div class="container narrow center">
    <span class="eyebrow">My approach</span>
    <h2>You can always leave later. First, let's figure it out</h2>
    <hr class="rule center">
    <p class="lead">Most relationship courses teach you to leave. «You deserve better», «don't put up with it», «run at the first red flag». That's not how I work.</p>
    <p class="lead">I'm for figuring it out. Understanding what's really happening, your own part in it, and the tools to change it. Not because you have to endure — but because most relationship problems are solvable. If you know how.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 3. WHO I AM -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container grid grid-2" style="align-items:center">
    <div class="photo photo--round">
      <img src="/assets/photo-round2.webp" alt="Valentina Ageeva" loading="lazy">
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Who I am</span>
      <h2>My name is Valentina</h2>
      <hr class="rule">
      <p>I'm not a psychologist out of a textbook — I'm a woman who went through her own «stay or leave», her own losses, and came back. I trained as a political scientist, then as a teacher of social studies (master's degree). Along the way I built a serious professional track — major city events (including Ural Music Night), the Ministry of Foreign Affairs, political work. And alongside it — a solid collection of hard lessons in my personal life.</p>
      <p>From the outside it might have looked fine — years together, not the worst hand. But I know what it's really like from the inside. And I know that «not so bad» and «truly good» are very different things.</p>
      <p>Now I help others not to step on the same rakes — leaning not on esoterics, but on Gottman, Sue Johnson, attachment theory, and my own real experience.</p>
      <a href="/en/about.html" class="btn btn-ghost">My story →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 4. TWO DOORS -->
<section class="section bg-blush">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="center">
      <span class="eyebrow">Where to start</span>
      <h2>Two doors — choose yours</h2>
      <hr class="rule center">
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-2" style="margin-top:38px">
      <a href="/en/free.html" class="card">
        <span class="ico">✦</span>
        <h3>Free test</h3>
        <p>Find your attachment style in 5 minutes. You'll see why you react the way you do — and where it comes from.</p>
        <span class="more">Take the test →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/en/course.html" class="card">
        <span class="ico">❤</span>
        <h3>Course «Relationships for a Lifetime»</h3>
        <p>10 steps from «we fought again» to «we're a team». On-demand — on your own or together with me.</p>
        <span class="more">See the course →</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 5. WHY TRUST ME -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container narrow center">
    <span class="eyebrow">Why you can trust me</span>
    <h2>I'm not a theorist and not a psychologist</h2>
    <hr class="rule center">
    <p class="lead">And I don't pretend to be one. Everything I talk about, I've lived: choosing «the wrong ones», the same endings, losses, betrayals, a wall of mistrust, loneliness inside a couple, fights on a loop, the feeling that you're carrying it all — and I know how to get out of it.</p>
    <p class="lead">I build not on intuition, but on those who studied this for decades: Gottman — 45 years of researching couples in the lab; Sue Johnson — therapy tested in the clinic, not at «feel the universe» workshops. I simply translated it from the scientific into the human.</p>
    <p class="lead" style="font-family:var(--serif);font-style:italic;color:var(--rose-ink)">Behind me are three generations of women who knew how to build relationships. <strong>I'm the fourth.</strong></p>
    <p class="lead">And yes — I'm <strong>for family</strong>. Not «run at the first sign», not «you deserve better, so be alone», not «you're strong and self-sufficient — you need no one». But to figure it out and repair it — if there's something to repair. If there isn't — at the very least you'll understand yourself. And that's already a result.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- WHO IT'S NOT FOR -->
<section class="section bg-blush">
  <div class="container narrow">
    <div class="center">
      <span class="eyebrow">Honest upfront</span>
      <h2>Who the course is NOT for</h2>
      <hr class="rule center">
    </div>
    <div class="panel no" style="margin-top:10px">
      <ul>
        <li>If you're looking for proof that you should leave — I won't give it.</li>
        <li>If you want to learn how to change a man — also not for me.</li>
        <li>If there's violence in the relationship — see a specialist first.</li>
        <li>If you're expecting soft hugs and «it'll all be fine» — I'll be honest, often uncomfortably so.</li>
        <li>If you just want to listen, nod, and do nothing while getting a magic pill of happiness — this isn't it. Here you work, you don't observe. This is the real world, not a made-up plot from a soap opera.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 6. SOCIAL PROOF -->
<section class="section bg-cream2">
  <div class="container center">
    <span class="eyebrow">The first group has finished</span>
    <div class="bignum">5 women</div>
    <p class="lead narrow">made it to the finish of the first group — gathered by word of mouth, without a single rouble on ads. Here's what they say:</p>
    <div class="quotes" style="margin-top:36px;text-align:left">
      <div class="quote"><p>«I started snapping at my husband less, valuing him more and saying out loud what a good man he is. At first he was surprised, then he got used to it. And what I noticed — he started taking initiative himself. Without me asking a hundred times and without fights.»</p><div class="who">— participant of the first group</div></div>
      <div class="quote"><p>«It's all built so logically — at first you don't get where it's going, and then the pieces fall into place. It's so interesting how everything shifts once you start applying the small changes from each step. And what comes next… 🚀»</p><div class="who">— participant of the first group</div></div>
      <div class="quote"><p>«There was resistance to doing the homework — because I knew it works. The «I want to but it stings» kind. Thank you for showing how to use intelligence in dealing with men in a feminine way.»</p><div class="who">— participant of the first group</div></div>
      <div class="quote"><p>«It became an inner turning point. The delivery is alive, without worn-out scripts. The feedback helps you see yourself from the outside. I can feel it — this is only the beginning.»</p><div class="who">— participant of the first group</div></div>
      <div class="quote"><p>«I didn't expect it to work so fast. For the next year or two I'll keep working on myself to become a Woman of the healthy kind. School doesn't teach what this course gives — and that's a shame.»</p><div class="who">— participant of the first group</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 7. FINAL CTA -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-band">
      <span class="eyebrow">Second group — starts July 26</span>
      <h2>Don't know where to start — start with the test</h2>
      <p>5 minutes, free, and it's already clearer what's actually going on with you. And from there the course is within reach.</p>
      <div class="btn-row center">
        <a href="/en/free.html" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Take the free test →</a>
        <a href="/en/course.html" class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg">Straight to the course →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</Layout>
